<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- DSM H1 operating profit by division.</title>
<headline>TABLE- DSM H1 operating profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1997 operating profit by division.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated).</p>
<p>    Hydrocarbons/polymers			  264  vs   72</p>
<p>    Base chemicals/fine chemicals		183  vs  314</p>
<p>    Resins/plastic products			 88  vs   74</p>
<p>    Energy/other activities			107  vs  122</p>
<p>First half 1997 sales by division.</p>
<p>(billions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Hydrocarbons/polymers			 2.82  vs  2.06</p>
<p>    Base chemicals/fine chemicals	     2.08  vs  1.90</p>
<p>    Resins/plastic products		     1.34  vs  1.20</p>
<p>    Energy/other activities (millions)	 230  vs  189</p>
<p>    Intragroup supplies (millions, debit)    345  vs  157</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
